  "implemented": [
    "Trusted native per-turn conversation review with a fresh finite Infer grant and native admission checks binding the reviewed model, worker, prompt commitment and output budget; no private inference result or grant enters WebKit",
    "Independent singleton GTK input controls: explicit local PNG and interactive portal screenshot selection, held push-to-talk PCM, finite sampled portal video, visible state, stop/lock/session-loss revocation and suspend-inclusive deadlines",
    "Exact local capture/sample/digest selection or clarification refusal, bounded PNG validation and exclusive private local saving; capture is not transcription, model submission or native publication authority",
    "Separate fixed audio/video capture workers and reviewed AppArmor domains, bounded memory/bytes/duration and owned-process drainage; no ambient screen-grab, persistent portal permission, arbitrary pipeline or network source",
    "Separate first-Admin Windows five-minute inference purpose, continuous authenticated authorization/UTC checks, resource observation, cancellation/ACK barriers and uncertain-generation recovery; thirty-second deterministic compute remains unchanged",
    "Explicit enrolled-file Read to fresh independently reviewed inference handoff; Read receipts and original-file bytes never become Infer authority",
    "Pinned Qwen3-4B CPU completion profile, finite streamed model staging and closed runtime/ELF packaging, excluding the interactive CLI, server program/implementation, RPC and GPU plugins",
    "Noninteractive completion through sealed model/prompt descriptors with fixed framing and no backslash interpretation; returned UTF-8 is retained verbatim as data, never commands or authority",
    "Unsigned populated profile-W package constructed and fully read back on Linux, exclusively exported to public D storage and independently inspected by a freshly compiled source-pinned C# archive/profile inspector"
  ],
